{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_07_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_07","title":"守護者","storyCode":"SV-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"1edd541e59bc2d70d4e4c0e7f3e5bc940004292e74f454eea4c3c6fcc328ef96","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂下定決心，應主教邀請，前去教堂。與此同時，審判官決定炸毀教堂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"今天拿的夠多了吧？除了我、佩特拉奶奶、長凳的份......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，還有歌手，歌手還會回來的吧？也不能讓她餓肚子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的......還有多。可以存盒子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，壁爐叔，你想要嗎？那、那我還是先給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇，你胳膊上纏著的這些好像是海藻欸！給我吧，我要試試做歌手教我的......呃，海藻酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，長凳呢？一晃眼又跑哪裡去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀......啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......歌......啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別啃。不能吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木框，木框......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別叫她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你幫我把琴帶給她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴她......不，你沒法告訴她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還不是再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去問問題。然後，我會自己說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我們現在就要在山體上安置爆破物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面，我看見一個人進了教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"她看起來和我們之前遇見過的那個外來人......很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那，長官，她到底是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說了，她和恐魚戰鬥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......除了我們之外，竟然還有人知道這些怪物，專門和這些怪物戰鬥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們炸毀教堂......她會受到波及嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不解決首惡，將這裡毀滅也無用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣嗎？所以還是得知道，是誰在這裡引起了異象......長官也不能確定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你不可問你任務之外的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，雖然我知道長官你不在意，但我還是想說說......這個區塊的承重結構，承受不住我們設計的爆炸的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"南半側的城市隨時都可能塌陷，這裡的居民卻還不知道這個消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去疏散他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕他們在長官你看來是古怪的，有問題的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......應該被淨化的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"判官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"說出你的職責！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"“我是為了伊比利亞的存續，為了同伊比利亞的敵人而戰，為了守衛伊比利亞的潔淨與德行，提起了劍與燈！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你必須對他們做出判決！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"判決？判處他們......死刑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，你上一次聽到過去的歌聲，是什麼時候？那些唱片，都已經壞了吧？你的機器也落灰很久了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽見那首歌。我聽見了這個阿戈爾人給他們唱的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的歌，是伊比利亞原本該有的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"在殺死他們以前，我想知道真相。就像長官你想揪出幕後主使者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他們還是會變異，到那時候，我一定會親手淨化他們，但現在我想讓他們先去避難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，如果你同意，我立刻就會去進行疏散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的判決？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮，你不止在對面前的人下判決。你也在對其他人下判決！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你判決怪物生，就是判決人民死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白！這樣的判決，我已經下過許多次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你的判決，既可能阻絕災難，也可能帶來噩兆！你可能救一人而殺百人，也可能殺百人而救一人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白，長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡面的利害關係，道德和經文的衝突......我都明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你這個了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你的是，艾麗妮，這種責任是你能承擔得了的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你會帶來痛苦，你就必須也遭受痛苦，而且要比你施加給別人的那些罪惡加起來還要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你有這種膽識嗎？你的信仰會在你遭受內心折磨時動搖嗎？如果你失敗了，你造成了惡果，你會因此一蹶不振嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......我能承擔。我不會動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"在我加入審判庭的時候，我就已經這麼做了。我能。如果我做錯了，那麼就讓我遭受責罰。我必須做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了。現在去履行你的職責，判官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"——是，長官！我立刻就去疏散當地居民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，長官......經匣裡剩下的爆破物應該夠炸毀整座鹽風城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"如有必要，你的判決將被我廢除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去了，老師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，大審判官閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，看看是誰來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎你，吟遊歌手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
